@challengeSlug = d2-raid-flawless
@challengeId = 019bdfec-fd36-77c2-9be1-5feee291090e


### 1. GET Challenge (user NON connecté)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeSlug}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 2. GET Challenge (user connecté - DOIT afficher hasVoted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeSlug}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{token}}


### 3. POST Vote (voter pour le challenge)
POST {{baseUrl}}/challengeVote/challenges/{{challengeId}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{token}}


### 4. GET Challenge APRES vote (hasVoted DOIT être true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeSlug}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{token}}


### 5. DELETE Unvote (retirer son vote)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/challengeVote/challenges/{{challengeId}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{token}}


### 6. GET Challenge APRES unvote (hasVoted DOIT être false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeSlug}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{token}}